ight-main\">Subscribe</a></li></ul> </nav> <fieldset class=\"oa-theme oa-site-switch-bar\" data-oa-theme-for=\"a16-1440-light\"> <legend class=\"oa-theme-legend\">Theme</legend> <div class=\"oa-theme-row\"> <label class=\"oa-theme-item\"> <input class=\"oa-theme-input\" type=\"radio\" name=\"oa-theme-a16-1440-light-bar\" value=\"light\" checked=\"\" style=\"\"> <span class=\"oa-theme-face\"><svg class=\"oa-theme-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-icon=\"U-selected-check\" data-icon-family=\"utility\"><use href=\"#oa-sym-u-selected-check-24px\"></use></svg><span class=\"oa-theme-label\">Light</span></span> </label> <label class=\"oa-theme-item\"> <input class=\"oa-theme-input\" type=\"radio\" name=\"oa-theme-a16-1440-light-bar\" value=\"dark\" style=\"\"> <span class=\"oa-theme-face\"><span class=\"oa-theme-label\">Dark</span></span> </label> <label class=\"oa-theme-item\"> <input class=\"oa-theme-input\" type=\"radio\" name=\"oa-theme-a16-1440-light-bar\" value=\"device\" style=\"\"> <span class=\"oa-theme-face\"><span class=\"oa-theme-label\">Match my device</span></span> </label> </div> </fieldset> </div>  </header><nav class=\"wa-bar oa-surface-charcoal\" aria-label=\"Atlas views\" data-oa-disclosure=\"\"><div class=\"wa-bar-in\"><p class=\"wa-name\"><span class=\"n\">Who Do They Answer To?</span><span class=\"wa-sub\"><span class=\"ws-nb s1\">The Oath &amp; Action Systems Atlas</span><span class=\"dot s1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> · </span><span class=\"ws-nb\" data-status-date=\"2026-10-15\">Snapshot of <time datetime=\"2026-10-15\">October 15, 2026</time></span></span></p><ul class=\"wa-views\" id=\"a16-1440-light-views\" hidden=\"\"><li><a class=\"oa-masthead-row-link oa-masthead-part\" href=\"/atlas\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"oa-masthead-row-link oa-masthead-part\" href=\"/atlas/loops\">Loops</a></li><li><a class=\"oa-masthead-row-link oa-masthead-part\" href=\"/atlas/reforms\">Reforms</a></li><li><a class=\"oa-masthead-row-link oa-masthead-part\" href=\"/atlas/register\">The Register</a></li><li><a class=\"oa-masthead-row-link oa-masthead-part\" href=\"/atlas/how-to-read\" aria-current=\"page\">How to read</a></li></ul></div></nav><nav class=\"wa-crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol><li><a href=\"/atlas\">Home</a><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span></li><li><a href=\"/atlas/how-to-read\" aria-current=\"page\">How to read</a></li></ol></nav><main id=\"a16-1440-light-main\" class=\"ws-main\" tabindex=\"-1\"><section class=\"wa-sec\" data-oa-section=\"Marks\" aria-labelledby=\"a16-1440-light-h1\"><div class=\"ws-g wa-head\"><div class=\"wa-op\"><h1 class=\"ws-h1 wa-t1\" id=\"a16-1440-light-h1\">How to read our atlas</h1><p class=\"ws-intro\">Each mark below appears on our atlas’s pages, and its row says what the mark means.</p></div></div><div class=\"ws-g\"><h2 class=\"ws-h2\" id=\"a16-1440-light-m0\">Signs and types</h2></div><div class=\"ws-g\"><ul class=\"wa-marks wa-col12\"><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 88 16\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L77 8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><g class=\"tg\"><polygon points=\"29,0 43,0 49,8 43,16 29,16\"></polygon><rect class=\"sg\" x=\"32\" y=\"7\" width=\"8\" height=\"2\"></rect><rect class=\"sg\" x=\"35\" y=\"4\" width=\"2\" height=\"8\"></rect></g></g><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M77 12L87 8L77 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Plus sign, raises</b><span class=\"wa-small\">The two variables tend to move the same way: when one rises, so does the other.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 88 16\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L77 8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><g class=\"tg\"><polygon points=\"29,0 43,0 49,8 43,16 29,16\"></polygon><rect class=\"sg\" x=\"32\" y=\"7\" width=\"8\" height=\"2\"></rect></g></g><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M77 12L87 8L77 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Minus sign, lowers</b><span class=\"wa-small\">The two variables tend to move in opposite directions: when one rises, the other falls.</span><p class=\"wa-small wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"glossary\">A positive sign does not mean a benefit.</p></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 55 16\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L44 8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M44 12L54 8L44 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Money, information, ownership</b><span class=\"wa-small\">A word before the verb says what moves along the connection. With no such word, the connection is causal: a change in one variable changes the other.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 88 16\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L73 8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><polygon class=\"dm\" points=\"87,8 80,13.5 73,8 80,2.5\"></polygon></g></svg></span><span><b>Open diamond, decides</b><span class=\"wa-small\">One body holds legal power over something, such as setting a rate. It carries no sign and never closes a loop.</span></span></li></ul></div><div class=\"ws-g\"><h2 class=\"ws-h2\" id=\"a16-1440-light-m1\">Grades</h2></div><div class=\"ws-g\"><ul class=\"wa-marks wa-col12\"><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 55 16\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L44 8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M44 12L54 8L44 4Z\"></path></g></svg><svg class=\"rs\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect></svg></span><span><b>Documented</b><span class=\"wa-small\">On the public record. A solid line, with a filled square before the word.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 55 16\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L44 8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M44 12L54 8L44 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Well supported</b><span class=\"wa-small\">Strong research evidence. A solid line.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 55 16\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L44 8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7.82 3.91\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M44 12L54 8L44 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Plausible</b><span class=\"wa-small\">Some evidence. A dashed line.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 55 16\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L44 8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"8.60 3.22 2.15 3.22\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M44 12L54 8L44 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Contested</b><span class=\"wa-small\">Evidence disputed. A line of dashes and dots.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 55 16\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L41 8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 5.00\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M44 12L54 8L44 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Hypothesis</b><span class=\"wa-small\">Not yet tested. A dotted line.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"rs\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect></svg></span><span><b>Record square</b><span class=\"wa-small\">The public record itself shows this connection.</span></span></li></ul></div><div class=\"ws-g\"><h2 class=\"ws-h2\" id=\"a16-1440-light-m2\">Delay</h2></div><div class=\"ws-g\"><ul class=\"wa-marks wa-col12\"><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 88 16\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L77 8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"tk\" d=\"M13 3L13 13\"></path></g><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M77 12L87 8L77 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>One tick</b><span class=\"wa-small\">The effect takes under 2 years.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 88 16\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L77 8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"tk\" d=\"M13 3L13 13\"></path><path class=\"tk\" d=\"M18 3L18 13\"></path></g><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M77 12L87 8L77 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Two ticks</b><span class=\"wa-small\">The effect takes 2 to 10 years.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 88 16\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L77 8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"tk\" d=\"M13 3L13 13\"></path><path class=\"tk\" d=\"M18 3L18 13\"></path><path class=\"tk\" d=\"M23 3L23 13\"></path></g><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M77 12L87 8L77 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Three ticks</b><span class=\"wa-small\">The effect takes over 10 years.</span></span></li></ul></div><div class=\"ws-g\"><h2 class=\"ws-h2\" id=\"a16-1440-light-m3\">Loops and reforms</h2></div><div class=\"ws-g\"><ul class=\"wa-marks wa-col12\"><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 88 16\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"rl\" d=\"M1 9.5L77 9.5\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path><path class=\"rl\" d=\"M1 6.5L77 6.5\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M77 12L87 8L77 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Hollow line</b><span class=\"wa-small\">A step of a loop with no complete chain of numbered connections, which the atlas describes in words.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln tgt\" viewBox=\"0 0 148 24\" width=\"148\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-red=\"working\" data-red-job=\"where a reform acts\"><path class=\"ak-case\" d=\"M1 12L137 12\" fill=\"none\"></path><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 12L137 12\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><g class=\"tg\"><polygon points=\"59,4 73,4 79,12 73,20 59,20\"></polygon><rect class=\"sg\" x=\"62\" y=\"11\" width=\"8\" height=\"2\"></rect><rect class=\"sg\" x=\"65\" y=\"8\" width=\"2\" height=\"8\"></rect></g></g><g class=\"hi\"><g class=\"tg\"><polygon points=\"56,1 74,1 82,12 74,23 56,23\"></polygon><rect class=\"sg\" x=\"60\" y=\"11\" width=\"10\" height=\"2\"></rect><rect class=\"sg\" x=\"64\" y=\"7\" width=\"2\" height=\"10\"></rect></g></g><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M137 16L147 12L137 8Z\"></path></g><g class=\"hi\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M125 21L147 12L125 3Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Red target</b><span class=\"wa-small\">Where the chosen reform acts: the connections it changes and the outlines of the variables it targets. On Newsprint a red connection carries a thin Charcoal edge.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><span class=\"oa-chip\" data-atlas-kind=\"Reform\" data-atlas-id=\"R-48\">Reform <span class=\"oa-chip-id\">R-48</span></span></span><span><b>Also aim here</b><span class=\"wa-small\">Other reforms that aim at the same place, in plain ink, so the red stays with the reform you chose.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 55 16\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"ak-mark\" d=\"M1 8L44 8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7.82 3.91\"></path><g class=\"lo\"><path class=\"hd\" d=\"M44 12L54 8L44 4Z\"></path></g></svg></span><span><b>Weakest step</b><span class=\"wa-small\">The least certain step in a loop. The loop holds only as firmly as this step.</span></span></li></ul></div><div class=\"ws-g\"><h2 class=\"ws-h2\" id=\"a16-1440-light-m4\">On every page</h2></div><div class=\"ws-g\"><ul class=\"wa-marks wa-col12\"><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><span class=\"oa-chip\" data-atlas-kind=\"Loop\" data-atlas-id=\"R18\">Loop <span class=\"oa-chip-id\">R18</span></span></span><span><b>Typed chip</b><span class=\"wa-small\">The kind of record and its code together, such as <a class=\"oa-chip oa-chip--link\" href=\"/atlas/loops/r18\" data-atlas-kind=\"Loop\" data-atlas-id=\"R18\">Loop <span class=\"oa-chip-id\">R18</span></a>. A chip with an underline opens the record.</span></span></li><li><span class=\"wa-mk\"><span class=\"oa-toggle wa-q wa-qs wa-qon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"oa-toggle-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-icon=\"U-selected-check\" data-icon-family=\"utility\"><use href=\"#oa-sym-u-selected-check-24px\"></use></svg></span></span><span><b>Pressed question</b><span class=\"wa-small\">A check, bold words and a heavier edge mark the question you pressed.</span></span></li></ul></div></section></main><footer class=\"ws-foot\" data-oa-section=\"Footer\"><div class=\"ws-g\"><div class=\"ws-foot-lists\"><nav aria-label=\"Site map\"><div class=\"ws-g\"><div class=\"grp\"><h2 id=\"a16-1440-light-fg0\">Our work</h2><ul aria-labelledby=\"a16-1440-light-fg0\"><li><a href=\"/explain\">Explain</a></li><li><a href=\"/track\">Track</a></li><li><a href=\"/connect\">Connect</a></li><li><a href=\"/act\">Act</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"grp\"><h2 id=\"a16-1440-light-fg1\">The atlas</h2><ul aria-labelledby=\"a16-1440-light-fg1\"><li><a href=\"/atlas\">Who Do They Answer To?</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"grp\"><h2 id=\"a16-1440-light-fg2\">Oath &amp; Action</h2><ul aria-labelledby=\"a16-1440-light-fg2\"><li><a href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"/subscribe\">Subscribe</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"grp\"><h2 id=\"a16-1440-light-fg3\">Help</h2><ul aria-labelledby=\"a16-1440-light-fg3\"><li><a href=\"/contact\">Contact us</a></li></ul></div></div></nav></div></div><div class=\"ws-strip oa-surface-charcoal ws-panel\"><div class=\"ws-g\"><div class=\"row\"><p class=\"sig\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-oa-master=\"20261109_Lockmark-24px-Master-Outline\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" data-red=\"signature\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#oa-app-id-20261109-lockmark-24px-master-outline\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"/></svg><span>A country that answers to its people.</span></p><p class=\"addr\"><span>oathandaction.org</span><span class=\"ws-illus\">Illustrative</span></p></div></div></div></footer></div></div></div></foreignObject></svg></div>"
